## Completion standard

A row closes only when every applicable link exists:

`authoritative configuration/data -> server policy -> persistence -> API/transport -> Svelte UI -> runtime behavior -> executable verification`

A control that only renders, a schema key with no consumer, a test that only matches comments, or a provider-shaped placeholder does not count. Security-bearing facts are derived or signed server-side. Failures at authorization and controller boundaries fail closed.

